cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FunWake, please cite it as below."
title: "Automated Optimization Discovery for Wind Farm Layout Optimization using Large Language Models"
abstract: >-
  FunWake applies the FunSearch paradigm to wind farm layout optimization: LLM
  coding agents iteratively write optimizer schedules, evaluated on wind farms
  held out from the search.
